{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19785","headline":"出门行 二 · 孟郊","name":"出门行 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海风萧萧天雨霜，穷愁独坐夜何长。\n驱车旧忆太行险，始知游子悲故乡。\n美人相思隔天阙，长望云端不可越。\n手持琅玕欲有赠，爱而不见心断绝。\n南山峩峩白石烂，碧海之波浩漫漫。\n参辰出没不相待，我欲横天无羽翰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}